<main class="zd-support-page">

  <section class="zd-support-hero">

    <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
      Support the Mission
    </p>

    <h1>
      Help build technology that helps people live better.
    </h1>

    <p>
      Every app, product, article, and experiment on this site is being
      built by a solo developer with a long-term vision:
      creating tools that help people focus, grow, learn, read,
      and become more intentional.
    </p>

    <div class="zd-support-actions">

      <a href="#support-options" class="zd-support-btn zd-support-btn--primary">
        Support the Mission
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zd-support-btn zd-support-btn--secondary">
        Explore Projects
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="zd-support-why">

    <div>
      <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
        Why support matters
      </p>

      <h2>
        Building meaningful software takes time.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>
        Support helps fund development tools,
        hosting, testing devices, design work,
        software licenses, infrastructure,
        and the time required to turn ideas
        into products people can actually use.
      </p>

      <p>
        Instead of chasing addictive engagement,
        these projects are designed around
        helping people improve their lives.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="support-options" class="zd-support-options">

    <div class="zd-support-section-head">
      <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
        Ways to help
      </p>

      <h2>
        Choose the option that fits you.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-support-grid">

      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Buy Products</h3>

        <p>
          Purchasing journals, merchandise,
          books, and future products directly
          supports development.
        </p>

        <a href="/collections/all">
          Shop Products →
        </a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Join Early Access</h3>

        <p>
          Test apps before launch and help shape
          future features.
        </p>

        <a href="#newsletter">
          Join Waitlists →
        </a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Share the Projects</h3>

        <p>
          Tell friends, family, students,
          creators, and communities about
          the mission.
        </p>

        <a href="/pages/community">
          Join Community →
        </a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Direct Support</h3>

        <p>
          Future sponsorship and donation
          options will help accelerate development.
        </p>

        <a href="#">
          Coming Soon
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="zd-support-roadmap">

    <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
      What support helps build
    </p>

    <h2>
      The ecosystem.
    </h2>

    <div class="zd-support-roadmap-grid">

      <article>
        <h3>Goal Grower</h3>
        <p>Visual goal and habit tracking.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>MyJourney</h3>
        <p>Personal life operating system.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Blokkr</h3>
        <p>Distraction blocking and focus.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Kindlitt</h3>
        <p>Clean books and reading discovery.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Future Apps</h3>
        <p>New experiments and tools.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Journals, desk tools, books, and more.</p>
      </article>

    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="zd-support-founder">

    <div>

      <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
        The Founder
      </p>

      <h2>
        Why I am building this.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Ziyu Development started with a simple idea:
        technology should help people become better,
        not consume more.
      </p>

      <p>
        Every project is part of a larger vision
        to help people focus on what matters most.
      </p>

      <a href="/pages/founder-journey">
        Read the Founder Journey →
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="newsletter" class="zd-support-newsletter">

    <p class="zd-support-eyebrow">
      Stay Updated
    </p>

    <h2>
      Follow the build.
    </h2>

    <p>
      Receive updates, launch announcements,
      product releases, and project progress.
    </p>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'zd-support-form' %}

      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="contact[tags]"
        value="newsletter"
      >

      <input
        type="email"
        name="contact[email]"
        placeholder="Email address"
        required
      >

      <button type="submit">
        Join
      </button>

    {% endform %}

  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Support Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Support Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}